;
; VAG-COM label file
;
; VW Golf (1K) / VW Touran (1T)
; VW Caddy (2K) / Seat Altea (5P)
; Skoda Octavia (1Z)
;
; component: immobilizer (#25)
;
; T/N: 1K0 920 870 F
;
; includes measuring blocks
;
; This is a redirect file that should
; make all instrument clusters work with
; 1 label file.
; This effects the following cars:
;
; VW Golf (1K) / VW Touran (1T)
; VW Caddy (2K) / Seat Altea (5P)
; Skoda Octavia (1Z)
;
; This file is part of a redirection package,
; make sure you have all of the following files.
;
; 1K-17.LBL
; 1T-17.LBL
; 1Z-17.LBL
; 2K-17.LBL
; 5P-17.LBL
; 1K-25.LBL
; 1T-25.LBL
; 1Z-25.LBL
; 2K-25.LBL
; 5P-25.LBL
; 1K0-920-xxx-17.LBL
; 1K0-920-xxx-25.LBL
;
; by Sebastian Stange
; sebastian@ross-tech.com
;
; This label file is partly based on
; informations from http://www.openobd.org
;
; last modification: 03/23/2005
;
; requires VAG-COM 405.0 or newer
;
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
; measuring block informations
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
;
001,1,Engine start,permitted,Range: 1 = yes / 0 = no
001,2,ECU,Communication,Range: 1 = yes / 0 = no
001,3,Key,Condition
001,4,Key,Count,max. 8 Keys
;
002,1,Authentification
002,2,Key/Transponder,Status
002,3,Fixed Code,allowed
002,4,Immobilizer,Status,see labelfile (Specification: 6)
; 1 - new wire
; 2 - Wire programmed
; 3 - Engine Control Module (ECM) wire programmed
; 4 - Customer Service new
; 5 - Customer Service blocked
; 6 - Immobilizer adapted
; 7 - Key programming active
;
003,0,Lock Time
003,1,Login-Lock,Tester,wrong Login (Specification: 0)
003,2,Login-Lock,CAN-Bus,wrong PIN (Specification: 0)
003,3,Lock,Scan Protection,Key (Specification: 0)
003,4,Status,Immo-LED,see labelfile (Specification: 0)
; 0 - without malfunction (LED off)
; 1 - Enabling not possible (LED 1Hz)
; 2 - Adaptation active (LED 1-2 s)
; 3 - Input malfunction (LED 2Hz)
; 4 - Adaptation error (LED 1Hz)
; 5 - Malfunction in line mode (LED 4Hz)
; 6 - Confirmation active (LED 2s + 1Hz)
;
004,0,Unknown
;
007,1,Brand (Key),Recognition
;
080,0,Manufacturer work number and identification
; Date of manufacture
; Manufacturer changing status
; Manufacturer test stand no.
; Running manufacturer no.
; e.g. BPA = Bosch factory Ansbach
;
081,0,Vehicle Identification Number (VIN)
; Serial number
; Type test number
;
082,0,FTC/Serial number
;
